From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: add netdev_from_priv helper

The Airoha v7.2 networking changes use netdev_from_priv(), but the
helper is not available in Linux 6.18. Add the small upstream helper.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
---
 include/linux/netdevice.h | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

--- a/include/linux/netdevice.h
+++ b/include/linux/netdevice.h
@@ -2766,6 +2766,17 @@ static inline void *netdev_priv(const st
 	return (void *)dev->priv;
 }
 
+/**
+ * netdev_from_priv() - get network device from private data
+ * @priv: network device private data
+ *
+ * Return: network device containing @priv
+ */
+static inline struct net_device *netdev_from_priv(const void *priv)
+{
+	return container_of(priv, struct net_device, priv);
+}
+
 /* Set the sysfs physical device reference for the network logical device
  * if set prior to registration will cause a symlink during initialization.
  */
